                <stringProp name="Argument.value">{&#xd;
  &quot;prompt&quot;: &quot;Answer the following user&apos;s query based on the instruction and the context provided.## Role : You are a helpful assistant.## Instruction : - Never hallucinate or invent information not present in the provided context.- Generate topics only based on events present in the context.- Do not include assumptions or general Scrum advice that are not present in the context.- For attendance records, only consider the most recent date.- Do not mention entity names or internal event record structures appearing in the context.- Each topic should include an appropriate discussion point related to that topic.- Return the result as a bullet list without a title.- Use Context data from one day ago, but if today is Monday, use context data from three days ago (last Friday).- If you need to use time data, preserve the original format of any provided time data. For instance, do not convert numeric millisecond timestamps; return them exactly as received.- If the data is insufficient, say you don&apos;t know.## Output Language : 한국어## Output Format : The output data Type must be strictly in String List type. Do not include markdown formatting.### Output Example.[\&quot;answer-1\&quot;, ...]## User Query : 지난 주 업무 내용을 및 직원 근태 상태를 토대로 이번주 Daily Scrum 의 topic을 추천해줘## Context : Attendance2026-02-27[Member:7@NT:1]  modified. presentType : WorkFromHome, dutyType : Present2026-02-28[Member:20@NT:1] dutyType : Leave, leaveType : AnnualLeave2026-03-03[Member:1e@NT:1]  modified. presentType : WorkFromHome, dutyType : Present[Member:1s@NT:1]  modified. presentType : WorkFromHome, dutyType : Present2026-03-04[Member:1e@NT:1]  modified. presentType : Office, dutyType : Present[Member:7@NT:1]  modified. presentType : Office, dutyType : Present[Member:1h@NT:1]  modified. presentType : Offshore, dutyType : Present[Member:1u@NT:1]  modified. presentType : Office, dutyType : Present2026-03-05[Member:1q@NT:1] dutyType : Absent, absenceType : NoCallNoShow[Member:1s@NT:1] du